{"id": "ledgar/test/7256", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"During the Term, as compensation for the satisfactory performance of all duties to be performed by Executive hereunder, Qualstar shall pay Executive a base salary of $200,000 per annum (the “Base Salary”), to be paid in accordance with the Company’s usual payroll policies and practices less required deductions for state and federal withholding tax, Social Security, and any other applicable employee benefit contributions and taxes.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Entire Agreements\": null, \"Erisa\": null, \"Existence\": null, \"Expenses\": null, \"Fees\": null, \"Financial Statements\": null, \"Forfeitures\": null, \"Further Assurances\": null, \"General\": null, \"Governing Laws\": null, \"Headings\": null, \"Indemnifications\": null, \"Indemnity\": null, \"Insurances\": null, \"Integration\": null, \"Intellectual Property\": null, \"Interests\": null, \"Interpretations\": null, \"Ju